---
description: NuclearLang (.nuc) code
globs: **/*.nuc
alwaysApply: false
---

The `.nuc` files are NuclearLang, not TypeScript nor Dart. Follow AGENTS.md: read
`nuclear spec --brief --dialect {dialect}` before writing, and run `{check}` after each change.
Make it with the tools (`nuclear gen`, `nuclear make`, the MCP server, `nuclear add`): never write target code for a
feature nor translate TypeScript, Dart or Python into Nuclear by hand.
